pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "#FFFFFF"
elements:
- elementId: top-bar
  elementType: shape
  bounds: [0, 0, 1280, 6]
  shapeName: rect
  fill:
    type: solid
    color: $primary
- elementId: badge-bg
  elementType: shape
  bounds: [60, 12, 120, 20]
  shapeName: rect
  fill:
    type: solid
    color: $primary
- elementId: badge-text
  elementType: text
  bounds: [60, 12, 120, 20]
  content:
    fontSize: 12
    color: #FFFFFF
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.0
    align: [center, middle]
    wrap: False
    text: |
      CH08
- elementId: bg-title
  elementType: text
  bounds: [60, 40, 300, 35]
  content:
    fontSize: 24
    color: $primary
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.5
    text: |
      <p><strong>研究背景</strong></p>
- elementId: bg-body
  elementType: text
  bounds: [60, 80, 1160, 230]
  content:
    fontSize: 18
    color: $text
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.5
    text: |
      <p>商业 TEE 难定制、难验证。RISC-V 提供开放硬件/软件协同机会，需要可研究、可裁剪的 enclave baseline。</p>
- elementId: sep-line
  elementType: shape
  bounds: [60, 330, 1160, 1]
  shapeName: rect
  fill:
    type: solid
    color: $border
- elementId: sol-title
  elementType: text
  bounds: [60, 350, 300, 35]
  content:
    fontSize: 24
    color: $primary
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.5
    text: |
      <p><strong>解决方案</strong></p>
- elementId: sol-body
  elementType: text
  bounds: [60, 390, 1160, 260]
  content:
    fontSize: 18
    color: $text
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.5
    text: |
      <p>把 PMP region、security monitor、runtime 和 host ABI 组合成可扩展的开源 TEE 框架。实现 PMP-based enclave isolation 和软件/硬件协同设计。</p>
- elementId: source
  elementType: text
  bounds: [60, 690, 1160, 20]
  content:
    fontSize: 14
    color: $secondary
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.2
    text: |
      来源：Keystone: 开源 RISC-V TEE 框架｜证据等级：E1 / Foundational
- elementId: bottom-bar
  elementType: shape
  bounds: [0, 714, 1280, 6]
  shapeName: rect
  fill:
    type: solid
    color: $primary
